    "## Business requirements and cloud design",
    "Before moving to the cloud, evaluate the existing state (inventory of systems, data, dependencies), perform a business impact analysis (BIA) to know which functions are critical, and define functional requirements (what the system must do) and nonfunctional requirements (performance, availability, security). Perform a cost-benefit analysis: the cloud changes capital expenditure (CapEx) into operational expenditure (OpEx), but data transfer, storage and migration costs must be counted.",
