    "For deletion in the cloud, the best answer is almost always crypto-shredding; physical destruction is not possible for the customer.",
    "A legal hold overrides retention and deletion schedules.",
    "IRM questions often describe one feature (\"the author revokes access after sending\"): match it to remote rights revocation, dynamic policy control, expiration or audit trail.",
    "Content-based discovery inspects the data itself; metadata-based looks at attributes; label-based relies on existing tags."
