    "- STRIDE (Microsoft) : Spoofing (usurpation), Tampering (altération), Repudiation (répudiation), Information disclosure (divulgation), Denial of service (déni de service), Elevation of privilege (élévation de privilèges).",
    "- DREAD : notation des menaces selon Damage, Reproducibility, Exploitability, Affected users, Discoverability.",
